<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Malaki</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malaki</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Malaki vyadahika chawandikagwa hantu ha nkongo mwe kaline ya shano Kulisito henati Kwelekwa, vikuligana mihilimo 100 Waizulali weze wauye mweisi yawo kulawa ko usamizo Babeli. Mihilimo milongo mitatu hegu milongo mishano utambalisi wa Malaki hewinati, Waizulaeli wendaga wetikila mwitango wa muwoni Hagai na Zekaliya kuzenga uhya Inyumba ya Yelusalemu, 520-515 Kulisito henati Kwelekwa. Mna hadododo msuhi wawo wa hali pya wakalongozwa ni Zelubabeli ikonga kwingila kaseta. Mbuli za kumvikila Chohile na lujendo lwedi vikonga kwaga, mviko kwa Chohile niyo wajalwa, 1:6-14, walavyantambiko wengila ubwa mwe indima yawo, sigilizi ya Chohile niyo yabelwa, 2:1-16. Mbuli iyo imtenda muwoni uyo Malaki kuwatintisan wantu wahitwile vitendese lujendo mo wikazi wawo kwa kuwakumbusa ungi wa Chohile, 1:1-5 na kugamba nkanto yakwe ihajihi, 2:17-3:5 na 3:13-4:6. Kawatambalisiza kugamba Chohile namtume mndima ywakwe 3:10 uyo natende uge muwoni Eliya, 4:5. Mwe Mbuli Yedi mwe Lagano Hya lagano idyo dyalagiswa kuchintizwa mo undima wa Yohana mta Kubatiza uyo endaga na ndima ya kumalanya kwiza kwa Yesu Kulisito. Matayo 17:11-13 na Luka 1:17.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Ungi wa Chohile kwa Izulaeli, sula 1:1-5</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Wavu wa vilongozi we isi, sula 1:6-2:17</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Mlosi ywa Zumbejumbe, sula 3</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Zuwa dya Zumbe, sula 4</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAL 1" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Chohile awaunga Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 1:1" />Ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile amwinkile Malaki chani awagambile Waizulaeli. <verse eid="MAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 1:2" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Mazuwa yose siwaungani nyuwe.” Mna wantu wa Izulaeli wauza, “Kuchunga vivihi?” Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Togolani, Esau hendaga mlukolo ywa Yakobo? Hata ivyo simunga Yakabo, <verse eid="MAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 1:3" />niyo namwihiwa Esau. Sibalanga isi ya amagulu ya Esau uwo ulisi wakwe, siilekeila mauzi ya kwedijangwa.” <verse eid="MAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 1:4" />Uneva awelekwa wa Esau kugamba Waedomu, wagamba hata hegu imizi yawo ibalangwa nawaizenge uhya amahame yakwe. Mna miye Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose nagamba wadaha wazenge uhya, mna miye naniibogozole. Wantu nawawetange, Wantu wavu wafilwe maya ni Zumbe Chohile kale na kale. <verse eid="MAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 1:5" />Nanywi mnaziwona izimbuli izo kwa meso yenyu nambunkule na kugamba, “Ukulu wa Zumbe Chohile wabula hata kuse kwe imihaka ye isi ya Izulaeli!”<verse eid="MAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Chohile awakwahila walavyantambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 1:6" />Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose awagambilani vino nyuwe walavyantambiko mkubela idizina dyakwe, Mwana amtunya mwelesi ywakwe, mndima amtunya sekulu ywakwe. Uneva miye ni Tati yenyu, ni mbwani hamkunitunya? Uneva miye ni sekulu ywenyu ni mbwani mwanibela? Mna nyuwe mwauza, Suwe chikiubela vivihi? <verse eid="MAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 1:7" />Mwanibela kwa kunilaviza ntambiko ya nkande yo uzavu mlanga mwe imazabahu yangu. Mna nyuwe mwauza, Chiijela uzavu kwa vivihi? Mwaijela uzavu kwa kuibela imazabahu yangu. <verse eid="MAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 1:8" />Umo mkanilaviza ntambiko ya mnyama tuntu hegu aholomale hegu mnyonje, togolani uwo suwo wavu? Togolani chilongozi nelelwe hegu nawagilwe kudamanyizwa seivyo kumwinka mnyama sauyo? <verse eid="MAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 1:9" />Haluse, nyuwe walavyantambiko mlombezeni Chohile vileke achiwonele mbazi. Hegu mwamlaviza malavyo saayo, togolani nawahituleni amalombezo yenyu? <verse eid="MAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 1:10" />Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose agamba, Vyawagile apatikane mntu yumwenga mwenyu avugale izinyivi ze Inyumba ya Chohile chani msekujimba moto hewikuwagila mwe imazabahu yangu! Nyuwe hamkuniwagila naho sanizumile ntambiko yoyose mkunilaviza. <verse eid="MAL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 1:11" />Wantu kulawa mwe izisi zose, kukongela ulailo wa zuwa kubula uswelo wakwe, watunya idizina dyangu. Chila hantu wanivunkiziza ubani na kunilaviza ntambiko zikuzumilika, kwaviya idizina dyangu dyatunywa mwawo. <verse eid="MAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 1:12" />Mna nyuwe mwadibela idizina dyangu umo mkaijela uzavu imazabahu yangu, ne inkande mkulavya mlanga mwakwe mwaibela. <verse eid="MAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 1:13" />Nyuwe mwagamba, Izimbuli izo zichisokeza chaka! Naho mwanibela. Mwaniletela ntambiko za wanyama mpatile kwa kubunyanya, hegu waholomale hegu wanyonje, togolani nihokele ntambiko seizo mwemikono yenyu? Miye Zumbe Chohile nauza. <verse eid="MAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 1:14" />Aligitwe mntu yoyose akunidanta, akwelisa kunilaviza ntambiko za mnyama hena lema kulawa mwe idifyo dyakwe, mna anilaviza mnyama aholomale! Miye ni seuta mkulu na awantu mwe izisi zose wanivikila.<verse eid="MAL 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 2:1" />Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose awagambila walavyantambiko, “Haluse nyuwe walavyantambiko, nawalagizani vino, <verse eid="MAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 2:2" />mwaungwa mnitunye miye mwe chila mbuli mkudamanya, hamnanitegeleze naniwegaileni ligito, vintu mkwinkwa vileke mtumiye naniviligite. Naho chindedi siviligita kale, kwaviya amalagizo yangu hamkuyatolotoza. <verse eid="MAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 2:3" />Wana wenyu naniwakantile, hata nyuwe wenye kwachausa cho uwavu wenyu, nyuso zenyu nanizibande mavi ya awanyama wenyu we izintambiko. Naniwabalazeni mwite hale na miye. <verse eid="MAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 2:4" />Elo, nammanye kugamba siwenkani mwiko uno vileke lagano dyangu no lukolo lwa Lawi ditende dya mazuwa yose.” <verse eid="MAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 2:5" />“Mwe idilagano idyo siwelisiza ujima na utondowazi na kugamba wowo wanivikile na kunitunya miye. <verse eid="MAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 2:6" />Mahinyo yawo yendaga ya chindedi naho hawajezaga kuwahinya udanti. Miye na wowo nachikala kwa utondowazi. Siyo kugamba wadamanya uwagila uwodu, mna wawahinya watuhu wasekudamanya wavu. <verse eid="MAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 2:7" />Ni ndima ya walavyantambiko kuwahinya wantu umanyi wa chindedi kumlanga Chohile. Wantu wawabase wakahine kwawo viya hunga, kwaviya walavyantambiko ni walosi wa Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose.” <verse eid="MAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 2:8" />“Mna nyuwe walavyantambiko mhituka na kuileka isila yo uwagila. Mahinyo yenyu yawalongoza wantu walozize mwe kutenda mbuli zihiye. Mtula idilagano nidamanye na nyuwe. <verse eid="MAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 2:9" />Miye nami naniwatendeni mbelwe na kuhufywa ni Waizulaeli, kwaviya hamtimile izisila zangu, naho umo mkawahinya wantu wangu mwahingiza awamwe wawo.”<verse eid="MAL 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu sawo wakanuni kwa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 2:10" />Togolani, suwe chose sawo wana wa tate yumwenga? Togola, suwe chose hachumbigwe ni Chohile uyudya? Elo, ni mbwani chikubalanga lagano dya Chohile adamanye na wakale wetu kwa kuswesa ukanuni chila yumwenga kwa mnyawe? <verse eid="MAL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 2:11" />Wantu wa Yuda waswesa ukanuni kwa Chohile na kudamanya mbuli zikwihiza mweisi ya Izulaeli na komzi wa Yelusalemu. Waijela uzavu Inyumba ya Chohile ikungiswa ni Zumbe Chohile. Naho wasola wavyele wakuvikila milungu ya chijeni. <verse eid="MAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 2:12" />Zumbe Chohile awabalazize hale wantu wakutenda mbuli seizo wamlawe mwa awelekwa wa Yakobo. Naho wesekwehanga mo kulavya ukuzi na kuleta ntambiko kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose. <verse eid="MAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 2:13" />Ukaleka ayo yose, mwaigubika imazabahu ya Zumbe Chohile kwa mesozi yenyu, mkaila na kulomboleza kwaviya uyo hakuzizumila vituhu izintambiko zenyu mkumletela. <verse eid="MAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 2:14" />Nyuwe mwauza, “Ni mbwani vino haluse hakuzizumila?” Zumbe Chohile hakuzizumila kwaviya kavimanya pwilili kubalanga ndagano yako kwa mkaziwo ywo ubwanga wako. Kuswesa ukanuni kwakwe hata hegu nakwelisa kulongozi kwa Chohile kugamba notende mkanuni kwakwe. <verse eid="MAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 2:15" />Togola, Chohile hawatendileni nyose waidi mtende mwili umwenga na loho imwenga? Togola nakekamba mbwani umo akadamanya ivyo? Vyadahika kekamba cheleke wana na wamvikile uyo. Elo, manyani kugamba hahana hata nyumwenga mwenyu akuswesa ukanuni kwa mkaziwe. <verse eid="MAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 2:16" />Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli agamba, “Neihiwa kwasana. Neihiwa yumwenga ywenu akamdamanyiza mkaziwe unyakwili sauwo. Kombaganyani kugamba hahana hata yumwenga mwenyu akuswesa ukanuni kwa mkaziwe.”<verse eid="MAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zuwa dya nkanto dihajihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 2:17" />Mumsokeza Zumbe Chohile kwa milosi yenyu ibule, hata ivyo mwagamba, “Chimsokeza zeze?” Mumsokeza umo mkagamba, “Wose wakudamanya wavu ni wedi kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, naho awaunga.” Na umo mkauza, “Ekuhi yudya Chohile mta uwagila?”<verse eid="MAL 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 3:1" />Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose agamba, “Natuma mlosi ywangu anilongoile kunimalanyiza sila. Zumbe mkulonda naizile Inyumba ya Chohile kwa chipumpa. Mlosi mkugoja kwa nkwina neze na kutambalisa lagano dyangu.” <verse eid="MAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 3:2" />Mna ni yuhi najijimize mwe idizuwa idyo nezile? Uyo ni saviya moto mkali ukufula chuma, ni saviya sabuni ya mfula shuche. <verse eid="MAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 3:3" />Uyo neze saviya mntu akusunta na kukukiza chumbu. Nawasunte awelekwa wa Lawi enga mntu akusunta zahabu hegu chumbu, kubula wamlavize Zumbe Chohile ntambiko zikuzumilika. <verse eid="MAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 3:4" />Elo, izintambiko za awantu wa Yuda na Yelusalemu nazimuwagile Zumbe Chohile enga za wantu we chikale saviya mwe mihilimo ya chikale. <verse eid="MAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 3:5" />Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose agamba, “Naniwezileni vileke niwakantileni. Sanileke kulavya ukuzi mwa wantu wahitukile na wajenda uyaga na wakulavya ukuzi wa udanti, wakuwabunyanya wahakilwe ndima na wakuwabunyanya wajeni na wadya hewekunivikila miye.<verse eid="MAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fungu dya mlongo na ntambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 3:6" />Miye ni Zumbe Chohile, miye sikuhitukila. Mna nyuwe mwi welekwa wa Yakobo hamnati kusila pele. <verse eid="MAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 3:7" />Kukongela ichipindi cha awakale wenyu, mbela imiko yangu naho hamuitimile. Elo miye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile Mkulu nagamba, niwiyani miye nami naniwahitukileni. Mna nyuwe mwauza, ‘Nachikuwiye kwa vivihi?’ <verse eid="MAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 3:8" />Miye nawauzani, Togolani vichuma mntu akamdanta Chohile? Bule! Mna nyuwe mwanidanta! Mkaheza mwauza, ‘Chakudanta vivihi?’ Heye! Mwanidanta mwe fungu dya mlongo ne izintambiko zenyu. <verse eid="MAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 3:9" />Nyuwe hamwenga na awantu wenyu wose mligitwa kwachausa cha kunidanta. <verse eid="MAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 3:10" />Leteni fungu dya mlongo dyose mwe Inyumba yangu, chani mwe Inyumba yangu mtende na nkande ya kuchinta. Mkaheza mwadaha kunijeza. Nijezani seivyo, nanywi namuwone hegu saniwavuguileni amadilisha ya kwembingu na kuwenkani ujimbiko ulozize. <verse eid="MAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 3:11" />Wadudu wabanasi saniwaleke wabalange ulozo wenyu vituhu. Imizabibu yenyu kwezinkonde haileke kweleka zabibu. Miye Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose silonga. <verse eid="MAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 3:12" />Aho awantu mwe izisi zose nawawetangeni nyuwe wantu wajimbikwe kwaviya isi yenyu naitende si ya mbwedo. Miye Zumbe Chohile Mkulu silonga.” <verse eid="MAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 3:13" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Milosi yenyu itenda mizigo mwangu.” Hata ivyo mwagamba, “Kwani chimgamba mbwani?” <verse eid="MAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 3:14" />Nyuwe mgamba, Kumsankanila Chohile ni kwa bule. Kuna chibwani ukatimila amalagizo ya Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose, hegu kujeza kumlagisa kugamba chibalanga kulongozi kwakwe chikajenda enga wakulomboleza? <verse eid="MAL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 3:15" />Ivyo suwe chikuwona ni kugamba wata kweduvya nawo wakwelelwa mazuwa yose. Wantu wavu hamwenga na kuchumilwa kwawo, hata wakamjeza Chohile hawakukantilwa. <verse eid="MAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 3:16" />Wadya wakumvikila Zumbe Chohile walosana wowo wenye, Zumbe Chohile eva imilosi yawo. Kulongozi kwakwe niyo kwaikwa chitabu chiwandikwe lukumbusa lwa wadya wakumvikila na kumtunya. <verse eid="MAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 3:17" />Chiwandikwa vino, Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Awo nawatende wantu wangu, nawatende wangu wesimile mwe idizuwa diya naninuke kudamanya chiya nekambile. Saniwalumize saviya tati ya mntu hekumlumiza mwanawe akumsankanila. <verse eid="MAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAL 3:18" />Aho nambunkule vituhu ukwesimana kwa wantu wakanuni na wantu wavu, mntu akumsankanila Zumbe Chohile na hekumsankanila.”<verse eid="MAL 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAL 4" />
  <para style="s">Zuwa dya Zumbe Chohile dyeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 4:1" />Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose agamba, “Zuwa dyeza, idyo dyaka enga tanulu. Wata kweduvya na wavu wose nawadulwe umo na kutikimya enga mabuwa yanyaile, nawatikimye pele asekusigala hata luvili. <verse eid="MAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 4:2" />Mna kwa nyuwe mkunivikila miye, udahi wangu wa kuhonya nausomwele mwenyu saviya zuwa dina nguvu za kuhonya mwe imyale yakwe. Namfose mkapilikapilka saviya wadama wakufosa mwe didewa dyawo <verse eid="MAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 4:3" />Idizuwa idyo namuwajate wantu wavu, awo nawatende enga maivu hasi he izinyayo zenyu. Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose.” <verse eid="MAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 4:4" />“Kumbukani imiko ne izisigilizi na amalagizo yangu nimlagize Musa mndima ywangu kudya kolugulu lwa Holebu, chani awalagize wantu wose wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="MAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 4:5" />Mna umo hedinati kubula idizuwa idyo kulu na dikutisa, nanimtume muwoni Eliya. <verse eid="MAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 4:6" />Muwoni Eliya nawevanye welesi na awana wawo, hegu sivyo nanize na kuibalanga isi yenyu.”<verse eid="MAL 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 4" />
</usx>